  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Ninety-one goals in one year. Or seventeen in one Champions League. Which Ballon d'Or year was better?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "MESSI 2012 v RONALDO 2014",
        "sub": "Peak against peak",
        "pill": "SETTLED",
        "person": "messi"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lionel Messi, twenty twelve. Twenty-five years old and scoring like a video game.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "messi",
        "label": "Barcelona · 2012",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Seventy-three goals in the twenty-eleven, twelve season. Fifty of them in La Liga, a league record.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "MESSI 2011-12",
        "person": "messi",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "73",
            "l": "goals, all comps"
          },
          {
            "n": "50",
            "l": "La Liga goals"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then ninety-one goals in the calendar year. Gerd Muller's record of eighty-five, gone.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "GOALS IN A CALENDAR YEAR",
        "left": {
          "person": "muller",
          "label": "Muller 1972",
          "value": "85"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "messi",
          "label": "Messi 2012",
          "value": "91"
        },
        "stamp": "RECORD"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristiano Ronaldo, twenty fourteen. Twenty-nine, and hungry for Europe.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "ronaldo",
        "label": "Real Madrid · 2014",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fifty-one goals in the season. Thirty-one in the league. And seventeen in the Champions League, a record.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "RONALDO 2013-14",
        "person": "ronaldo",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "51",
            "l": "goals, all comps"
          },
          {
            "n": "31",
            "l": "La Liga goals"
          },
          {
            "n": "17",
            "l": "Champions League goals"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On numbers, Messi wins. Comfortably.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "SEASON GOALS",
        "left": {
          "person": "messi",
          "label": "Messi 11-12",
          "value": "73"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "ronaldo",
          "label": "Ronaldo 13-14",
          "value": "51"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But trophies. Messi's Barcelona won the Copa del Rey. Real Madrid took the league.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "person": "messi",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "cup",
            "label": "Copa del Rey 2012"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ronaldo won the Copa del Rey too, and La Decima. Real's tenth European Cup.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "person": "ronaldo",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "cup",
            "label": "Copa del Rey 2014"
          },
          {
            "kind": "bigears",
            "label": "Champions League"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Four-one after extra time against Atletico. Ronaldo scored in the final.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "realmadrid",
        "away": "atleti",
        "hs": 4,
        "as": 1,
        "date": "24 May 2014",
        "comp": "Champions League final",
        "note": "after extra time"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And here's the twist. Each man was the other's runner-up, and both won by a landslide.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "THE VOTE",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "2012: Messi",
            "value": "41.6%",
            "club": "barca",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "2012: Ronaldo",
            "value": "23.7%",
            "club": "realmadrid"
          },
          {
            "name": "2014: Ronaldo",
            "value": "37.7%",
            "club": "realmadrid",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "2014: Messi",
            "value": "15.8%",
            "club": "barca"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Messi won by eighteen points. Ronaldo won by twenty-two.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "WINNING MARGIN",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "18",
            "l": "points, Messi 2012"
          },
          {
            "n": "22",
            "l": "points, Ronaldo 2014"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So, settled. The greatest numbers ever belong to Messi. The better year to win things belongs to Ronaldo.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "THE VERDICT",
        "left": {
          "person": "messi",
          "label": "Numbers",
          "value": "WIN"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "ronaldo",
          "label": "Trophies",
          "value": "WIN"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pick one in the comments.",
